se,"probed":false,"coverage_suspect":true,"gap":"before_first_sighting","note":"This round predates our first sight of this host. Not a miss — we had not met."},{"sequence":5,"week":"2026-W36","taken_at":"2026-09-01T13:27:08.998Z","digest":"a69a2144fb5b0feee0da1003d6356dca331ccf58917e6f136ff369706d9f3722","entry_url":"https://scvd.store/corpus/5.json","listed":false,"probed":false,"coverage_suspect":true,"gap":"before_first_sighting","note":"This round predates our first sight of this host. Not a miss — we had not met."},{"sequence":7,"week":"2026-W37","taken_at":"2026-09-18T14:22:58.378Z","digest":"da260da1faab87a748e2f9e7685f3be15b0f06f9426ff75cc270632a5f730263","entry_url":"https://scvd.store/corpus/7.json","listed":false,"probed":false,"coverage_suspect":false,"gap":"before_first_sighting","note":"This round predates our first sight of this host. Not a miss — we had not met."},{"sequence":8,"week":"2026-W38","taken_at":"2026-09-20T11:00:28.668Z","digest":"dd18c0fd7408d4ab32e47b016a9641a1adf88aaba2cd69b143d239ac1a30f627","entry_url":"https://scvd.store/corpus/8.json","listed":false,"probed":false,"coverage_suspect":true,"gap":"possibly_beyond_cap","note":"The round hit its host cap, so this host may have been in the tail it never reached. We cannot tell which, and will not guess."}],"what_this_cannot_see":["Anything between rounds. The cadence is weekly, so a host that broke on Tuesday and was fixed by Saturday is invisible here and always will be.","Why a verdict changed. We record what a probe saw, never the cause.","Whether an absence is the host's doing or ours. That is what `gap` is for: read the reason, not the blank.","A bare figure, and this is a refusal rather than a limitation. Dividing rounds-ready by rounds-probed and printing the quotient alone would be a verdict without its derivation, which the house sentence forbids. Every dated observation is here; a derived reading of them is published elsewhere only with its rule, its denominator and its rows.","Anything before the corpus started. The chain is the record, and it does not reach back further than its first entry.","Listing history before the population register existed. `listing` began with the population layer, so on rounds older than the register the timeline can only draw on the chain — and the chain only records the hosts a round WALKED. A `not_listed` on one of those rounds may be an unrecorded listing.","Whether a host listed on the register's first day had been listed earlier. `first_seen` is when the register met it, not when the world did."],"asked_at":"2026-09-24T15:19:34.972Z","evidence_scope":{"signed":false,"description":"Unsigned host-history summary. The timeline, tier and gap counts are derived context, not a signed artifact. Each timeline entry links a corpus original: retain it and an independently established issuer key, verify its signature, then inspect snapshot.round.hosts for rows whose url exactly matches the requested endpoint, including the query string. Top-level snapshot metadata alone cannot establish absence of endpoint observations. The existing scvd-evidence verify-source command with --subject selects verified exact-URL rows; read their observation dates separately from snapshot publication time. A missing observed_at means the observation date of the signed row is unknown, not the snapshot publication time or a date supplied by this unsigned timeline; it cannot establish observation-age freshness. To authenticate several weeks, retain and verify each cited original and report its own row dates and gaps. One verified snapshot does not authenticate other weeks or this summary."},"feed_url":"https://scvd.store/feeds/host/bix-creator-edge.liara.run.xml","tier":{"tier":"indeterminate","line":"indeterminate — 0 of 1, W38","protocol":"x402","fraction":{"ready":0,"rounds":1,"first_week":"2026-W38","last_week":"2026-W38","weeks":"W38"},"rule":"fewer rounds than the rule needs, or our coverage of this host was suspect in the window","latest":{"verdict":null,"observed_at":null,"source":null},"coverage_suspect":true,"window":{"rounds":1,"established_needs":4,"standing_needs":8},"rows":[{"sequence":8,"week":"2026-W38","taken_at":"2026-09-20T11:00:28.668Z","entry_url":"https://scvd.store/corpus/8.json","observed":false,"gap":"possibly_beyond_cap","coverage_suspect":true}],"criteria_url":"https://scvd.store/criteria"},"store_links":{"store":{"name":"SCVD General Store","homepage":"https://scvd.store","llms_txt":"https://scvd.store/llms.txt","agents_md":"https://scvd.store/agents.md","menu_json":"https://scvd.store/menu.json","openapi_json":"https://scvd.store/openapi.json","skill_md":"https://scvd.store/skill.md","developers":"https://scvd.store/developers","verify_url_template":"https://scvd.store/api/verify/{id}","signing_key":"https://scvd.store/.well-known/scvd-signing-key","preflight":"https://scvd.store/api/preflight/v1","conformance_desk":"https://scvd.store/api/conformance/v1"},"next":[{"item":"spot_check","name":"Spot Check","price_usdc":0.001,"url":"https://scvd.store/api/buy/spot_check?host=bix-creator-edge.liara.run","why":"bix-creator-edge.liara.run answers; a spot check is one signed observation of it now, outside the weekly round","source":"host_tier"},{"item":"passport_refresh","name":"The Refresh","price_usdc":1,"url":"https://scvd.store/api/buy/passport_refresh?host=bix-creator-edge.liara.run","why":"the newest observation of bix-creator-edge.liara.run is the weekly round's; a refresh is a new one now","source":"host_tier"}],"derivation":"next is derived, never typed: items that share a use_when recipe with this one (menu.json use_when), the deeper rung of the room this path belongs to, the settlement observation for the transaction just settled, and the instrument this host's own tier picks. In derivation order, then the catalogue's order; never by price, never by sales, never a ranking. store is the same roster on every envelope this store serves."},"cite":"scvd.store, host history bix-creator-edge.liara.run, observation date not stated; ed25519-signed, key at https://scvd.store/.well-known/scvd-signing-key; bytes at https://scvd.store/corpus/host/bix-creator-edge.liara.run.json.","cite_format":"One line to quote verbatim: the issuer, what and which, when it was observed, how it is signed and where the key is, and the URL whose bytes are the thing cited. A citation names an observation, never a judgment.","cite_json":null,"cite_how":"Cite a row by its entry URL and digest, never by restating it. The digest is the one the corpus index commits to; if the row's bytes ever changed, the chain check at /corpus.json would fail, which is what makes the citation checkable. No probed row yet; a gap is cited as a gap, never as a zero."}